    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d219">

                <pb facs="0368" n="1832" sameAs="frus:frus1951v06p2/pg1832"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">357.AB/9–751: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in India</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Henderson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New Delhi</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-09-07T10:00:00+05:30">September 7,
                            1951—10 a. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>874. Took occasion this morning express view Graham as suggested last para Deptel
                    524 Sept 6. He replied he had given matter careful consideration. Fact was
                    however he had already recd informally from both govts replies to points and
                    suggestions contained in document to be presented to them today. He did not
                    believe therefore it wld serve any useful purpose him stay on merely in order
                    receive formal document setting forth what had already been given him
                    informally. He convinced time has come for him leave SOA and is therefore going
                    on with plans set forth Embtel 871 Sept 6.</p>
                <p>Rptd info Karachi 57.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Henderson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
